@host = http://localhost:5045

### 1. Register a farmer (FR-01) -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ali Yilmaz",
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "role": "Farmer"
}

### 2. Register a consumer (FR-01) -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ayse Demir",
  "email": "ayse@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "role": "Consumer"
}

### 3. Log in as the farmer (FR-01) -> 200
# @name farmerLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### 4. Create a listing as the farmer (FR-02) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Tomato",
  "category": "Vegetables",
  "unitPrice": 25.00,
  "unit": "Kg",
  "availableQuantity": 50,
  "location": "Izmir"
}

### 5. Search listings (FR-03)
GET {{host}}/api/listings?search=tomato

### 6. Log in as the consumer
# @name consumerLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ayse@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### 7. Consumer tries to create a listing (NFR-03) -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{consumerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Apple",
  "category": "Fruits",
  "unitPrice": 30.00,
  "unit": "Kg",
  "availableQuantity": 20,
  "location": "Antalya"
}

### 8. Wrong password -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 9. Invalid listing data -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "",
  "category": "Vegetables",
  "unitPrice": -5,
  "unit": "Kg",
  "availableQuantity": 0,
  "location": "Izmir"
}